# Web3Forms access key for the "Connect with me" form.
# This key is public by design: it ships in the browser JS of any site that uses Web3Forms,
# and it can only send form submissions to the account owner's inbox. Committed so every
# production build (GitHub Pages docs/ and Vercel) has it.
